silm:instances_papers_01_orientation_chapters_14_kleisli_enrichment_pipeline_sections_02_enrichment_by_type_information_concrete_anchor_1#vetrecord77 silm:hasLongDescription "The VetRecord77 is The veterinary record olog object whose hom-set into Mittens contains exactly one typed arrow: \"about\". This is the concrete example that makes the Set-enrichment claim tangible: one vet record, one \"about\" arrow, one hom-set element." .
